Oxiot
$cards
DECK 1 {SPADES, CLUBS}

$initial
RIPE 3 FACE_ALL
RIPE 9 FACE_ALL

QOUQ 8 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
QOUQ 3 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
QOUQ 3 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST

